Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.82,0:00:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The public doesn't realize it, but\Nthere's an evil lurking in Morioh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.50,0:00:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like a silent disease slowly\Nravaging our town from the inside out,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.60,0:00:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and every day more and\Nmore lives are being taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.38,0:00:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's worse, these killings have\Ngone completely unnoticed for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.76,0:00:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's shocking to say the least, the\Nthought of it's downright chilling.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.28,0:00:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we have no way of tracking down the\Nmurderer, no matter how hard we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.34,0:00:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, we still don't know how\Nmany stand users are even in Morioh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.56,0:00:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But people aren't worried about some\Nsilent killer coming after them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.86,0:00:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're too preoccupied with\Nwhat they're having for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.38,0:00:48.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone is completely blind to what's\Ngoing on outside their immediate view.
