Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.14,0:00:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Best I checked, I had 20,000 in savings!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.90,0:01:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,12 yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.12,0:01:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to work on my spending habits.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.74,0:01:16.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That 20,000 yen was for those\Ndope designer shoes I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.76,0:01:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell else could I have\Nspent that amount of money on?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.10,0:01:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is that crusty old man's fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.36,0:01:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He charged a hundred and thirty thousand
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.02,0:01:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yen to my cart when he\Nbought that baby shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.40,0:01:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I have to admit the\Ngeezer paid me back in full.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.56,0:01:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that I got bit by\Na mysterious spending
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.88,0:01:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bug and my money sense\Nflew right out the window!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.06,0:01:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll get lucky and find a\Nthousand yen laying around somewhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.40,0:01:40.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,though the odds of that are slim to none!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.06,0:01:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a disgusting roach.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.02,0:01:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a health code\Nviolation if I ever saw one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.40,0:02:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.98,0:02:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.89,0:02:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got one man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.14,0:02:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.52,0:02:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was right, it's a stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.52,0:02:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just when I thought this\Nday couldn't get any worse.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.64,0:02:45.81,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HFAF2ED&}taisetsu na mono ubawaresou
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.64,0:02:45.81,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HFAF2ED&}Something important is being taken from me
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.81,0:02:48.23,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HFAF2ED&}nichijou ni magirekonda akuma
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.81,0:02:48.23,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HFAF2ED&}By a demon that's thrust itself into my life
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.23,0:02:51.60,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC4B3D4&}heion nara tokkuni kuzuresatteru
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.23,0:02:51.60,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC4B3D4&}Everything is crumbling around me
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.23,0:02:51.60,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC4B3D4&}heion na toki kuzuresatteru
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.23,0:02:54.40,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}nanigenai soshite sarigenai
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.23,0:02:54.40,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}Living my life as if everything was fine
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.10,0:02:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.40,0:02:56.78,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}kizu ga nai uchi ni ubawareteita
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.40,0:02:56.78,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}Until suddenly it was stolen away without warning
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.78,0:03:00.24,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}torikaeshi ni iku nara ima sa
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.78,0:03:00.24,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}This is my only chance to take it back
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.24,0:03:04.58,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HF8E3D2&}tsuranuita ya no youna surudosa de
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.24,0:03:04.58,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HF8E3D2&}Those who fight with a heart pierced by the arrow
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.58,0:03:08.08,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HF8E3D2&}butsukeau kokoro wa utsukushii
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.58,0:03:08.08,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HF8E3D2&}Are a beautiful sight to behold
Dialogue: 1,0:03:08.08,0:03:09.12,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}{\1c&HF8E3D2&}doko mademo chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:03:08.08,0:03:09.12,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}{\1c&HF8E3D2&}Anywhere you go I'll chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.12,0:03:10.75,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}{\1c&HC3F0FA&}doko mademo chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.12,0:03:10.75,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}{\1c&HC3F0FA&}Anywhere you go I'll chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.75,0:03:12.88,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC3F0FA&}itsumo chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.75,0:03:12.88,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC3F0FA&}I'll always chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.88,0:03:15.04,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC3F0FA&}ore wa chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.88,0:03:15.04,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC3F0FA&}I will chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.04,0:03:16.63,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}nigeba wa nai
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.04,0:03:16.63,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}You can't escape me
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.63,0:03:19.30,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}hashiridase chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.63,0:03:19.30,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}Run faster as I chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.30,0:03:21.43,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}asu mo chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.30,0:03:21.43,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}Even tomorrow I'll chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.43,0:03:24.30,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}tataki tsukete yaru no sa
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.43,0:03:24.30,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}Until I finally pummel you
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.30,0:03:29.93,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&&HEEF7F1&&}shouhai wo wakeru nowa shunen sa
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.30,0:03:29.93,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&&HEEF7F1&&}My perseverance will propel me forward to achieve victory
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.30,0:03:29.93,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&&HEEF7F1&&}shouhai wo wakeru nowa shuunen sa
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.93,0:03:35.82,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&&HEEF7F1&&}dakara I Chase You
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.93,0:03:35.82,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&&HEEF7F1&&}Which is why I chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.82,0:03:42.41,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,643)\pos(143,890)\fs60}Episode 18: {\fs80} Shigechi's Harvest, Part 1
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.82,0:03:42.41,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,643)\pos(143,890)\fs60}Episode 18: {\fs80} Shigechi's Harvest Part 1
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.36,0:03:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.08,0:03:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell is it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.26,0:03:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.18,0:03:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, what the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.68,0:03:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're about to get\Nslaughtered, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.26,0:04:00.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.17,0:04:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, heyya, Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.68,0:04:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, there's an enemy stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.32,0:04:05.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna squash him to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.66,0:04:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now there are two of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.48,0:04:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I followed one of those little\Npests all the way from the bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.68,0:04:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did the one you're after attack you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.98,0:04:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he didn't actually attack me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.98,0:04:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was trying to buy a bottle\Nof Calpis water when suddenly
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.12,0:04:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it popped out from under the\Nvending machine and took off!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.92,0:04:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.83,0:04:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean it didn't try\Nto pick a fight with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.74,0:04:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then why were you ranting about\Nwanting to squash it to death?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.46,0:04:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause the stupid little\Nbastard startled me so
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.62,0:04:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bad I spilled the damn\Nwater all over my uniform!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.40,0:04:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want my money back, damn it! I got one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.24,0:04:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.24,0:04:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like another one of\Nthose things joined the pack!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.64,0:04:43.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.55,0:04:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.06,0:04:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are so many of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.44,0:04:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're like a pint-sized army!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.54,0:04:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu, try not to\Ntake this the wrong way,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.84,0:04:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they kind of remind me\Nof your brother's Stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.16,0:04:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, the fact that they're completely\Nignoring us is giving me a bad feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.76,0:05:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really creepy if you ask me. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.56,0:05:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.82,0:05:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The user is probably somewhere nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.90,0:05:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Focus.
