Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.20,0:05:25.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.46,0:05:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's money!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.37,0:05:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right, it took a one yen\Ncoin from under the ATM at the bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.06,0:05:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As crazy as it is, I'm pretty sure\Nall those coins are the real deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.70,0:05:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great work, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.14,0:05:38.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are some good pickings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.18,0:05:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like they say, a yen\Nsaved is a yen earned.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.08,0:05:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And counting all the money that\Nwe've saved, this makes 5,000 yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.26,0:05:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I have you by my side harvest,\NI'll have everything I need to get by.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.84,0:05:54.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.26,0:05:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you see the way\Nhe's talking to that stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.76,0:05:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must be the user given\Nhow chummy they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.32,0:06:00.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.30,0:06:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like another sorry chump\Ngot tagged by the bow and arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.62,0:06:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But going by his goofy attitude, it\Ndoesn't seem like he wants to hurt anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.86,0:06:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.46,0:06:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh wow, this is so neat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.44,0:06:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no clue other people\Ncould see my harvest too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.18,0:06:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, you can\Nreally see it, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.16,0:06:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so you know, they're\Ncalled stands. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.94,0:06:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Josuke Higashikata, and\Nthis here is Okuyasu Nijimura.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.74,0:06:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This means we're friends,\Nmy very first friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.96,0:06:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.20,0:06:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I should tell you that\Nmy name is Shigeki Oyangu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.74,0:06:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm an eighth grader at\NBudogaoka Middle School.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.34,0:06:55.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I weigh 110 kilograms and\Nmy mommy and daddy call
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.26,0:06:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me Shigechi because I'm\Ntheir special little man.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:57.85,0:07:03.86,Note,,0,0,0,,Note: "chan" is a Japanese suffix used to express endearment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.90,0:07:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First they called me little\NShige, but now it's Shigechi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.78,0:07:03.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I also have a pet turtle\Nand his name is Kinoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.40,0:07:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was home the other\Nday and all of a sudden
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.04,0:07:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had the urge to find out whether the 41,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.06,0:07:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,62, and 150 yen stamps tasted the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.18,0:07:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I started licking them all over and\Nmy mommy yelled at me something fierce.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.14,0:07:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a picture of my mommy,\Nthe one who yelled at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.38,0:07:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.34,0:07:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy shit, your mom is actually\Npretty easy on the eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.58,0:07:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.52,0:07:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh, question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.38,0:07:28.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These things are called Harvest, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.76,0:07:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were they really the ones who\Npicked up all these coins?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.80,0:07:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bet they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.94,0:07:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They got them from ditches in\Nthe bottom of vending machines,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.58,0:07:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm not a robber if\Nthat's what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.74,0:07:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already talked to the\NKoban policeman about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.40,0:07:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said it wasn't necessary to return\Ncoin denominations less than 100 yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.70,0:07:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing pees me off more\Nthan doing bad things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.14,0:07:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think there's anything\Nbad about what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.82,0:07:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you ask me, you're\Ndoing society a big favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.62,0:07:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no boatload of cash,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.04,0:07:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you're taking forgotten funds and\Nputting them back into the Japanese economy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.82,0:07:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're doing great work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.24,0:08:03.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.15,0:08:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.07,0:08:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think it's great?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.72,0:08:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean you think I'm great too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.84,0:08:08.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.04,0:08:11.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, talk about being\Nhidden in plain sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.12,0:08:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to hand it to the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.76,0:08:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one would ever think of\Ncollecting money like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.56,0:08:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.38,0:08:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a freakin' genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.90,0:08:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.81,0:08:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may have heard you incorrectly, but did\Nyou happen to say I was a freakin' genius?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.14,0:08:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one has ever said anything\Nlike that to me before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.20,0:08:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've picked up 120,000\Nyen since I started...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.10,0:08:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,120,000?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.76,0:08:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But your kind words make me even happier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.30,0:08:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you have 120,000\Nyen? Pretty good, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.74,0:08:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you scrounged together\Nall that money around Morioh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.38,0:08:43.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.29,0:08:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the only way to do things since\NI never stepped foot out of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.24,0:08:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could get lost and some Grip might\Ntake advantage of my innocence, hee hee.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.10,0:08:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.24,0:08:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have 12 yen and he's rolling in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.28,0:08:59.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aokuyasu, what's wrong\Nwith your left foot?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.30,0:09:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.98,0:09:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did 350 in coins end up\Nhiding right under my foot?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.34,0:09:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think this random money\Nmight belong to Shigekio?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.16,0:09:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He should keep an eye on his dash.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.08,0:09:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sneaky dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.70,0:09:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.02,0:09:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you guys half.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.20,0:09:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would that make you happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.44,0:09:18.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.35,0:09:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're each other's best\Nfriends now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.60,0:09:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can all hang out and do cool things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.34,0:09:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.25,0:09:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.28,0:09:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucky us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.04,0:09:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.00,0:09:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This just isn't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.20,0:09:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't just hand over\Nyour hard-earned money
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.08,0:09:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to complete strangers\Nlike it's nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.54,0:09:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, this time I'll put my back into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.88,0:09:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.24,0:09:38.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Half of all of this is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.10,0:09:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what friends are for, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.56,0:09:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grunting and scrunching up your\Nface doesn't make it right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.76,0:09:44.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.32,0:09:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you excuse us for a second, Shigechi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.64,0:09:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.06,0:09:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.66,0:09:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough of the goody-goody shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.40,0:09:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this turd boy wants to give us his\Nmoney, then who are we to turn him down?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.06,0:09:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, buddy, but my pride\Nwon't allow me to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.72,0:10:01.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just not right, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.42,0:10:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as it's not some shitty disease,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.56,0:10:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take whatever people are\Ngiven, so don't you judge!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.32,0:10:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.36,0:10:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't judging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.32,0:10:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chill out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.23,0:10:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.15,0:10:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you said...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.06,0:10:11.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I know how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.97,0:10:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not exactly raking\Nin yin myself, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.22,0:10:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But never fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.38,0:10:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just came up with a little idea\Nthat'll put everyone's minds at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.28,0:10:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.19,0:10:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really think it's possible\Nto make everyone happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.22,0:10:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heh, just leave everything to me!
