Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.98,0:10:39.82,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: "To all the good little boys and girls of Morioh: Let's play nice together!" - Town of Morioh
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.82,0:10:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh, Shigekyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.20,0:10:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, uh, do you mind\Nif I call you Shigechi?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.60,0:10:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'd love that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.68,0:10:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Shigechi, we\Ncan't take your money.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.42,0:10:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you were attempting\Nto do just now is honestly
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.96,0:10:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no different than trying\Nto pay for our friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.72,0:10:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.63,0:10:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't trying to do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.36,0:10:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I know you weren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.78,0:10:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you ask me, a friendship\Nis something you build over time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.90,0:10:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I was trying to do\Nwas make some new friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.56,0:10:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.58,0:11:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I know exactly how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.46,0:11:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We stand users have to stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.78,0:11:04.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.80,0:11:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what do you say we all do a\Nnice round of team building and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.38,0:11:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,strengthen our friendship with\Na little business venture?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.68,0:11:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.04,0:11:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Business venture? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.84,0:11:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before you know it, us three\Nare gonna be stinking rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.50,0:11:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do I stink?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.78,0:11:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, lots of cash. Go with me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.52,0:11:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only so much money you can make\Nby picking up leftover change, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.46,0:11:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know things have worked\Nout for you so far, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.00,0:11:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a much more lucrative\Napproach for harvests.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.74,0:11:29.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.86,0:11:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a better plan\Nthan picking up change?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.24,0:11:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This idea is legal, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.94,0:11:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there's nothing corrupt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.68,0:11:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And no one will get hurt in the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.20,0:11:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.64,0:11:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm liking what I'm hearing,\Nso what's your idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.22,0:11:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's where the\Nbusiness part comes in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.68,0:11:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as compensation for coming\Nup with this marvelous proposal,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.82,0:11:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you give us half the profits.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.40,0:11:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other half will go to you, Shigechi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.28,0:11:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The three of us are\Ngoing to have to put our
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.78,0:11:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,heads together if we want\Nto pull this thing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.78,0:11:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when all is said and done, we'll\Nfinally get the payday we deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.18,0:11:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds good, but I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.84,0:12:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's my job supposed to be in all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.30,0:12:04.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know what I'm holding?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.42,0:12:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a blue stamp. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.18,0:12:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It comes with every 100\Nyen purchased from Kameyu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.04,0:12:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must have heard of\Na chain this famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.00,0:12:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's one of Eastern Japan's\Nbiggest department stores.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.70,0:12:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the best part about these stickers is
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.68,0:12:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there are plenty of\Npeople who just toss them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.06,0:12:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.97,0:12:21.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But wait, there's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.42,0:12:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A 20 yen voucher from that\Nstationery store Meiwado.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.78,0:12:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here's a voucher from CD shop Oscar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.44,0:12:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten will get you 2,000\Nyen worth of merchandise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.10,0:12:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's one from the cleaners.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.70,0:12:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Marching Kids Toy Store.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.92,0:12:35.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this is a card from\NYotsuba Electronics.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.60,0:12:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now pay attention,\Nbecause this is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.10,0:12:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With a place like Kamayu,\Nif you use this sticker,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.56,0:12:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can get a little bit of cash back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.26,0:12:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see what you're getting at!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.22,0:12:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're as amazing as ever, Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.56,0:12:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the best plan I've ever heard!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.32,0:12:55.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, everybody, go\Ninto what you do best!
