Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.88,0:12:56.92,SFXYellow,2,0,0,0,,{\pos(964.956,25.884)\fade(255,0,255,-1340,-1339,49,50)}Rumble
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.90,0:13:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By themselves, these things are\Nas worthless as scraps of paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.28,0:13:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, if you use Harvest to pick up the tens\Nof thousands of them lying around town,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.98,0:13:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.89,0:13:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's an entirely different story!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.38,0:13:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.68,0:13:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This trash can!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.92,0:13:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that one!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.80,0:13:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it! Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.10,0:13:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it! Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.22,0:13:26.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.13,0:13:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They just keep piling up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.50,0:13:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've lost count of them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.66,0:13:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your stance the greatest ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.56,0:13:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing Shigechi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.96,0:13:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He he he he!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.87,0:13:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another compliment!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.42,0:13:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A few are torn, but I'll fix\Nthem with Shining Diamond!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.60,0:13:40.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.80,0:13:42.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must have thousands by now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.68,0:13:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the looks of it, it's\Nover a hundred thousand!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.98,0:13:45.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
