Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.56,0:13:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Josuke, what was that you\Nwere saying about your pride?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.80,0:13:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're such a smooth talker, it's\Nlike you do this for a living!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.10,0:14:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's gonna be so happy in\Nthe end, man, so it's all good!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.26,0:14:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, I have friends now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.56,0:14:06.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Friendship is the coolest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.26,0:14:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, Okuyasu, I'm getting kinda nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.46,0:14:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think Josuke's gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.52,0:14:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turning those thingies into\Nmoney sounds really tricky.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.66,0:14:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relax, Shigechi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.98,0:14:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give Josuke a chance to work his magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.90,0:14:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Okuyasu and, uh, who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.74,0:14:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.92,0:14:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.20,0:14:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd it go in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.56,0:14:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you manage to get our money?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.00,0:15:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They didn't tell you\Nto piss off, did they?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.20,0:15:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found out that the CD shop and toy\Nstore don't do cash back. That said,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.32,0:15:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we can exchange the coupons for about\N40,000 yen worth of CDs and video games.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.84,0:15:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, that doesn't matter right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.56,0:15:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about Kameyu?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.74,0:15:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell me you were able to\Nget cash for the Kameyu stickers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.02,0:15:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.60,0:15:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something unexpected came up last minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.82,0:15:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something unexpected?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.00,0:15:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got 61,500 yen back instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.78,0:15:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold the genuine article, Shigechi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.24,0:15:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh boy, oh boy, it's real money!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.78,0:15:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Real cash right before my very eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.66,0:15:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is like a dream come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.62,0:15:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.24,0:15:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your harvest is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.96,0:15:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No other stand's ever come close to\Nits prowess! Really? You mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.36,0:15:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think it's amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.52,0:15:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.72,0:15:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't usually get compliments.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.32,0:15:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys have been super nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.12,0:15:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.20,0:15:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really think I'm amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.18,0:16:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, have some faith\Nin yourself, Shigechi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.68,0:16:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you've got a power no one\Nelse could ever dream of having.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.92,0:16:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You keep talking like that, and\NI'll be a sobbing mess. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.40,0:16:12.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, doll face, I got a\Nfat stack of greenbacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.34,0:16:13.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wanna have some fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.96,0:16:23.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.87,0:16:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu Josuke, I've\Ngot something for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.14,0:16:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your cut, 10,000 large.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.02,0:16:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Shigechi, what the\Nhell is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.08,0:16:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The three of us are comrades in\Nbusiness and life, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.50,0:16:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, you'd say that\Nwe were friends, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.54,0:16:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.56,0:16:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.70,0:16:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the money I've gifted you is a\Ngenerous token of our new friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.90,0:16:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold up a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.24,0:16:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't the amount\Nwe agreed on, Shigechi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.82,0:16:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You promised us that we'd get half of\Nwhatever money we managed to scrape together!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.94,0:17:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Half of 61,500 yen is 30,750!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.42,0:17:05.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, I said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.04,0:17:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing you're saying rings any bells!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.02,0:17:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.93,0:17:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, it's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.66,0:17:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My harvest did all the work!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.14,0:17:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't remember you guys lifting\Na single finger to help out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.50,0:17:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The work was all me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.92,0:17:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you two don't realize it,\Nbut you're all talking no action!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.68,0:17:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your damn mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.46,0:17:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Josuke hadn't come up with\Nthe idea in the first place,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.12,0:17:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you never would have thought of\Npicking up those stupid stickers!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.88,0:17:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I would have come\Nup with it eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.00,0:17:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the amazing Shigechi, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.42,0:17:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.33,0:17:37.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way a babyhead like you\Nwould have thought of a plan like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.32,0:17:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop, Okuyasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.64,0:17:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do something you'll regret later!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.78,0:17:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.88,0:17:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The band's broken up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.44,0:17:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was happy to give us a few thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.28,0:17:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the moment we ask\Nfor a few ten thousands
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.72,0:17:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now we're stepping over\Nthe line all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.02,0:17:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He really doesn't mean any harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.88,0:18:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just has the mentality of\Na little kid no matter what we
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.50,0:18:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,say it's gonna feel like we're\Nduping him out of his money?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.50,0:18:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sucks royally, but we should be\Nthe adults here and call it a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.14,0:18:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We already got ten grand out\Nof it That's enough to get by
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.74,0:18:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess if you put it that\Nway leaving is the best option
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.58,0:18:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Melon Head over there\Nreally rubs me the wrong way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.36,0:18:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure he's not\Npulling a fast one on us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.74,0:18:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Okuyasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.86,0:18:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And fighting's not going\Nto get us anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.94,0:18:24.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to handle this delicately.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.70,0:18:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say we school him on how\Nmature adults do business.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.02,0:18:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sly dog, you're still\NEngland for the cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.70,0:18:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fickle bastard, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.62,0:18:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have I ever told you I\Nlove that brain of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.64,0:18:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You win, Shigechi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.00,0:18:40.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll gladly accept\Nthis amount as our cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.60,0:18:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.86,0:18:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want something to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.58,0:18:47.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pick anyone you want,\NI'm rich, so it's on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.60,0:18:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're treating, I'm drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.52,0:18:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you know, I think I\Nwant some cowpiece water.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.82,0:18:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.62,0:18:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, how come you're\Nthrowing those away?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.92,0:19:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because they're nothing but worthless junk\Nnow, just like year-end lottery tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.02,0:19:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember telling\NShigechi to pick these up
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.14,0:19:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when he was grabbing\Nall the other tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.16,0:19:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean these losing New\NYear's Lottery tickets?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.24,0:19:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just how would you know\Nif these were losing tickets?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.64,0:19:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's an easy one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.02,0:19:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's gonna throw away a\Nwinning ticket, you dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.62,0:19:19.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You say that,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.53,0:19:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I've heard that a lot of\Npeople forget to check their
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.18,0:19:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,numbers and then end up missing\Nout on claiming their prizes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.14,0:19:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this wins, you have to promise me I can\Ntake half of it for myself or wait clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.98,0:19:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine by me, half it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.16,0:19:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you win a sheet of stamps\Ninstead of cold hard cash,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.22,0:19:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll let you keep that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.92,0:19:37.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geez, Okuyasu,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.92,0:19:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never realized how much you liked\Nthose cheap little gambling games.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.86,0:19:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That one's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.66,0:19:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.26,0:19:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't really think about it before,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.42,0:19:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but do you think I can collect lottery\Nprizes if I'm still in high school?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.14,0:19:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see why you couldn't.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:51.75,0:19:56.38,Note,,0,0,0,,Note: In Japan, a custom stamp with your name on it is used in conjunction with a signature.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.82,0:19:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So long as you have your ID and name\Nstamp on you, it should be smooth sailing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.46,0:19:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,SG Group 121314.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.06,0:20:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, man, that's lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.58,0:20:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just another dud.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.02,0:20:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thought I had it this time. Guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.92,0:20:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, SG Group 1-2-1-3-1-4.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.56,0:20:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.24,0:20:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, question.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.80,0:20:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I happened to win the lottery by chance,\Nwould I have to take it to the police?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.32,0:20:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.36,0:20:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you turn it into them?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.14,0:20:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harvest only picked up\Nwhat people threw away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.32,0:20:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not stealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.38,0:20:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And besides that, unless you\Nwere to somehow magically win,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.62,0:20:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's a moot point, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.16,0:20:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But best of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.00,0:20:37.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.91,0:20:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is SG Group 1, 2, 1, 3, 1, 4! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.46,0:20:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,SG Group 1, 2, 1, 3, 1, 4?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:45.39,0:20:48.64,Note,Book,0,0,0,,On Book: "Winning Numbers List"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.44,0:20:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's SG Group 1, 2, 1, 3, 1, 4!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.78,0:20:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa there, what are you\Ngetting so worked up about?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.06,0:20:53.06,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: Prize...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:53.77,0:20:56.27,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: Prize - five million yen
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.74,0:20:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five million!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.82,0:20:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt about it, I won!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.44,0:21:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.82,0:21:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This better not be a stupid joke.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:03.78,0:21:04.65,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: Five million yen
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.80,0:21:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.16,0:21:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah! Dream come true! Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.42,0:21:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're the first to ever\Nexperience this greatness!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.44,0:21:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get ahead of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.68,0:21:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.10,0:21:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just double check to\Nmake sure you actually won.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.96,0:21:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,SG Group 121314, prize 5 million yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.98,0:21:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, there you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.04,0:21:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe, but it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.26,0:21:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't found this\Nlottery ticket when you did,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.86,0:21:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would have been off to the incinerator.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.72,0:21:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it expires in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.12,0:21:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to get this to the bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.50,0:21:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if they ask us a bunch of questions,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.32,0:21:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll tell them we bought\Nit fair and square.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.06,0:21:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and hope they believe us\Nso we can get the cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.32,0:21:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You good on that plan? You know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.72,0:21:48.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lie and get the dough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.54,0:21:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, we're going to\Nbe 5 million yen richer!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.36,0:21:54.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, what should I buy first?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.24,0:21:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know. I'll get some sick Italian shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.32,0:22:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'll buy a new designer suit\Nthat complements my sexy physique.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.30,0:22:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that, it's on to Tonio's\Nfor his most expensive dish.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.42,0:22:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And of course, I'll have to\Ngo somewhere cool abroad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.22,0:22:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm saving all my money!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.44,0:22:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.35,0:22:10.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about playing it safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.70,0:22:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My harvest did all the heavy lifting\Nwhile those two goofed around.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.48,0:22:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every last yen of that\Nfive million belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.14,0:22:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let them take it.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.88,0:22:52.26,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Any time I need to see your face, I just close my eyes
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.26,0:22:54.51,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And I am taken to a place where your crystal mind
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.51,0:22:57.31,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And magenta feelings take up shelter in the base of my spine
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.31,0:22:58.98,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Sweet like a chic-a-cherry cola
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.98,0:23:01.35,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I don't need to try to explain, I just hold on tight
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.35,0:23:03.73,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And if it happens again, I might move so slightly
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.73,0:23:06.53,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}To the arms and the lips and the face of the human cannonball
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.17,0:23:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the arms and the lips and the face of\Nthe humic and the ball that I need to,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.53,0:23:08.24,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}That I need to, I want to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.60,0:23:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.24,0:23:10.49,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Come stand a little bit closer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.51,0:23:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come and stand a little bit closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.28,0:23:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breathe in and get a bit higher!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.49,0:23:12.82,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Breathe in and get a bit higher
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.56,0:23:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never know what\Nhit you when I get to you!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:12.82,0:23:14.45,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}You'll never know what hit you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.45,0:23:17.08,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}When I get to you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.02,0:23:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I want you, I don't\Nknow if I need you?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:17.08,0:23:21.58,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:21.58,0:23:25.13,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I'd die to find out
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.96,0:23:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I want you!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.13,0:23:30.59,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.60,0:23:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I want you. I don't\Nknow if I need you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.32,0:23:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I've got to find out.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:30.59,0:23:33.97,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I would die to find out
